      "sha256": "8218ca6ff16b",
      "content": "# Preserve llama.cpp JNI bridge symbols during R8/ProGuard shrinking\n-keep class ai.mangal.core.llm.LlamaJniBridge { *; }\n-keepclasseswithmembernames class ai.mangal.core.llm.** {\n    native <methods>;\n}\n"
